# edwards25519's constants as binary literals (plits.bend: bn.bend's B.Bn,
# read by X.bvalo with the symbolic unit `one`), and their bridges to the
# specification's symbolic constants: p = FS.prime(one) = 2^255 - 19,
# d = -121665 / 121666 and I = sqrt(-1) (the group order L: lfacts.bend).
# Nothing here expands a 255-bit number: the literals stay under bvalo,
# stuck on `one`; the closed checks are B.beq on the literals. This file
# imports no certificate (cert_*.bend): it is light.

# ---- literals (plits.bend) under this file's names ----

